OL,3,GNEWSACould 'seasonal parking' charges
OL,4,Abe heading to Bath?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe introduction of extra "seasonal
OL,7,Fcharges" at council car parks during a
OL,8,FChristmas market is being considered.
OL,10,FBath and North East Somerset Council is
OL,11,Fconsidering the parking charges during
OL,12,Fthe weekends that Bath Christmas Market
OL,13,Fis on.
OL,15,FIf adopted, the change would not apply
OL,16,Fto this year's Christmas market, which
OL,17,Fbegins next month, instead coming into
OL,18,Feffect next year. People parking for
OL,19,Ffour hours or more would pay an extra
OL,20,F#1, while people parking for up to four
OL,21,Fhours would pay an additional 50p.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
