OL,3,GNEWSACould 'seasonal parking' charges
OL,4,Abe heading to Bath?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCabinet member Joel Hirst said the
OL,7,Flocal authority had "to make the best
OL,8,Fuse of the limited space we have on our
OL,9,Fstreets, while ensuring that our
OL,10,Fparking policies and charges remain
OL,11,Ffair".
